{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o069a","title":"秭归黄气记载","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o069a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"正文记秭归十余里内现宽数十丈的黄气。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o069a-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":{"text":"秭归","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o069a-q"]},"time":{"year":222,"label":"章武二年夏六月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y222","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o068","basis":"章武二年夏六月"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o069a-q","xianzhu-q-o068","xianzhu-q-b-e2b85eacbc16310809ee"]},"source_order":[32,403,"O069a"],"order":6612}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o069a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-5398e8ba8cc35262f80d","layer":"original","quote":"夏六月，黄气现自秭归十余里中，广数十丈。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":402,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-e2b85eacbc16310809ee","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-e2b85eacbc16310809ee","layer":"modern","quote":"〖7〗二年：章武二年（公元 222）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":413,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-18295fa1c5ff11c612db","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o068","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-8136daaf302c35b9c188","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖7〗，先主军还秭归；将军吴班、陈式水军屯夷陵，夹江东西岸〖8〗。二月，先主自秭归率诸将进军，缘山截岭，于夷道猇亭﹝二﹞驻营〖9〗。自佷山﹝三﹞通武陵〖10〗，遣侍中马良安慰五溪蛮夷〖11〗，咸相率响应。镇北将军黄权督江北诸军，与吴军相拒于夷陵道。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
